5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be very careful about the financial structure this year. I'll check the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the attendance sheets for the away camps.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'm more concerned about the actual quality of the stay. I'll look into the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I don't want the organizers to be too tired. I'll check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, and the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to see where the money actually goes. I'll look into group transport in three years of receipts and the attendance sheets for the away camps.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We need to make sure people actually bond. I'll check what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for the away camps.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
