30,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits based on a fixed headcount. Also, a fifth of the members didn't even show up to previous away camps.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Public beds are cheap at 1,100 yen, but other clubs reported eight people to a room and strict lights-out at eleven.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Public bookings require a nine-page application and a lottery. Also, cooking for ourselves on campus takes two hours a day.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Transport is the biggest cost, taking up to 38% of the budget. Like Asuka said, many people just don't attend the away trips.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Seniors say mixing only happens during the evenings when everyone sleeps in the same place. But many people drop out of the club after away camps.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if transport is that expensive and attendance is low, we are risking a lot of money on a trip people might skip.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, if the application is that tedious and the sleep quality is poor, public centers seem like a bad choice.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, I agree. And if we stay on campus, the cooking duty is a huge burden on the staff.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, exactly. We can't afford to pay for people who don't show up, especially with non-refundable deposits.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, but if we stay local, will we actually get the year-groups to mix? The seniors were quite clear about that.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, mixing is important, but not if it bankrupts the club or penalizes those who actually attend.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If we want quality sleep and less paperwork, we need to avoid the public dorms.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Minato,,I'm worried about the workload. A nine-page application sounds like a nightmare for whoever is organizing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a destination that minimizes financial risk. High transport costs and fixed deposits are dangerous.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I just don't want another camp where people only talk to their own year-group.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
