55,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is a bureaucratic mess and Option C is a financial risk due to the deposits. I prefer Option B.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Option A's sleep quality is terrible. Option C sounds more comfortable, but Option B is the safest.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A is too much work. Option B has the cooking issue, but Option C is far away. I'll go with B.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option C is too risky with the deposits. Option A has high transport costs. Option B is the only fiscally responsible choice.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option B won't help us mix because people go home. Option C is the best for bonding since it's a private building.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, we can't ignore that 20% of people don't even go. Option C would leave the attendees paying for the absentees.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, but Option A is out for me. Eight people to a room is not a training environment.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, if we do Option B, can we find a way to avoid the cooking duty?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, we can't change the canteen closure, but it's better than losing money on a lodge.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, if we don't take a risk, the club will just keep drifting apart.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I'm sticking with B. It's the only one that doesn't potentially leave us in debt.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll vote B. It's not ideal for sleep, but it's better than the lottery and the crowds of Option A.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote B to save the organizers from the paperwork of Option A.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I vote B. The budget cannot handle the risks of C or the transport of A.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting C. It's the only way to actually save the club's social atmosphere.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
